{"suttaId":"vv69","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Vv","vriCode":"s0506m.mul","paras":[2629,2634],"vripara":"1075"},"segments":{"vv69:0.4":"Dutiyaupassayadāyakavimānavatthu","vv69:1.1":"Sūriyo yathā vigatavalāhake nabhe … pe ….","vv69:2.1":"(Yathā purimavimānaṃ tathā vitthāretabbaṃ).","vv69:3.1":"“Tena metādiso vaṇṇo … pe …","vv69:3.3":"vaṇṇo ca me sabbadisā pabhāsatī”ti.","vv69:4.1":"Dutiyaupassayadāyakavimānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"unsure":[],"attha":{"book":"Vv-a","bookName":"Vimānavatthu-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0506a.att","from":3147,"to":3155,"paras":[{"para":3147,"vripara":"1075","refs":["vv69:1"],"lines":["“Sūriyo yathā vigatavalāhake nabhe … pe …."],"lineRefs":[["vv69:1"]]},{"para":3148,"vripara":null,"refs":["vv69:1"],"lines":["(Yathā purimavimānaṃ, tathā vitthāretabbaṃ;)"],"lineRefs":[["vv69:1"]]},{"para":3150,"vripara":"1079","refs":["vv69:3"],"lines":["“Vaṇṇo ca me sabbadisā pabhāsatī”ti."],"lineRefs":[["vv69:3"]]},{"para":3151,"vripara":null,"refs":["vv69:3"],"lines":["Tattha gāthāsupi apubbaṃ natthi;"],"lineRefs":[["vv69:3"]]},{"para":3152,"vripara":null,"refs":["vv69:3"],"lines":["Dutiyaupassayadāyakavimānavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["vv69:3"]]},{"para":3153,"vripara":null,"refs":["vv69:3"],"lines":["Bhikkhādāyakavimānavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["vv69:3"]]},{"para":3154,"vripara":null,"refs":["vv69:3"],"lines":["<b>Uccamidaṃ maṇithūṇaṃ vimānan</b>ti bhikkhādāyakavimānaṃ.","Tassa kā uppatti?","Bhagavā rājagahe viharati veḷuvane.","Tena samayena aññataro bhikkhu addhānamaggapaṭipanno aññataraṃ gāmaṃ piṇḍāya paviṭṭho ekassa gharaddhāre aṭṭhāsi.","Tattha aññataro puriso dhotahatthapādo “bhuñjissāmī”ti nisinno bhojanaṃ upanetvā pātiyā pakkhitte taṃ bhikkhuṃ disvā pātiyā bhattaṃ tassa bhikkhuno patte ākiranto tena “ekadesameva dehī”ti vuttopi sabbameva ākiri.","So bhikkhu anumodanaṃ vatvā pakkāmi.","So puriso “chātajjhattassa bhikkhuno mayā abhuñjitvā bhattaṃ dinnan”ti anussaranto uḷāraṃ pītisomanassaṃ paṭilabhi.","So aparabhāge kālaṃ katvā tāvatiṃsesu dvādasayojanike kanakavimāne nibbatti.","Taṃ āyasmā mahāmoggallānatthero devacārikaṃ caranto mahatiyā deviddhiyā virocamānaṃ disvā imāhi gāthāhi paṭipucchi –"],"lineRefs":[["vv69:3"],["vv69:3"],["vv69:3"],["vv69:3"],["vv69:3"],["vv69:3"],["vv69:3"],["vv69:3"],["vv69:3"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
